    "time": "20 to 60 minutes",
    "level": "Beginner",
    "intro": "A dim or dead headlight is a ticket and a safety risk. Most halogen bulbs swap from behind the light in minutes. Yellowed plastic lenses can cut light output badly, and a sanding kit restores them for less than one shop visit.",
